{"path":"pricing.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Investment — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#0f1724;--card:rgba(255,255,255,0.06);--glass:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.03),rgba(255,255,255,0.01));--accent:#8FD3C7;--muted:#9AA4B2;--glass-border:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,Segoe UI,Roboto,"Helvetica Neue",Arial}
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:radial-gradient(1200px 400px at 10% 10%,rgba(143,211,199,0.08),transparent),linear-gradient(180deg,#08101a 0%,#07121a 100%);color:#e6f7f1}
    header{position:sticky;top:12px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:18px 28px;margin:8px;border-radius:14px;background:var(--glass);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border:1px solid var(--glass-border);box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(2,6,10,0.6)}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .logo{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#7aabd4);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#042225;font-weight:700;box-shadow:inset 0 -6px 18px rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}
    nav a{color:#cdeee6;text-decoration:none;margin:0 10px;font-size:14px}
    nav a:hover{color:#fff}
    main{max-width:1100px;margin:36px auto;padding:28px}
    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:28px;align-items:start}
    .hero-card{padding:28px;border-radius:14px;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--glass-border);box-shadow:0 12px 36px rgba(2,6,10,0.6)}
    h1{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:28px;letter-spacing:0.4px}
    p.lead{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}
    .price-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;margin-top:18px}
    .plan{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}
    .plan .meta{max-width:66%}
    .plan h3{margin:0;font-size:16px}
    .plan p{margin:6px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    .plan .cta{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#7ac1d8);color:#042225;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px;border:none;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600}
    .disclaimer{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px}

    /* Proof Gallery */
    .proof{margin-top:28px;padding:18px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}
    .testimony{min-height:72px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}
    .quote{font-size:15px;margin:0 0 8px}
    .who{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    .badges{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:12px;align-items:center}
    .badge{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);padding:8px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03);font-size:12px;position:relative}
    .badge:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);transition:transform .18s}
    .tooltip{position:absolute;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);top:-40px;background:#02121a;color:#bfeee2;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap;display:none}
    .badge:hover .tooltip{display:block}

    footer{margin-top:36px;padding:18px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--glass-border);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
    .pattern{position:fixed;right:18px;bottom:18px;opacity:0.08;width:180px;height:180px}

    @media(max-width:880px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.logo{width:40px;height:40px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="logo">A</div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">Sanctuary for aromatic clarity</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Sanctum</a>
      <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
      <a href="blends.html">Formulas</a>
      <a href="shop.html">Apothecary</a>
      <a href="pricing.html" style="color:#fff;font-weight:600">Investment</a>
      <a href="about.html">Story</a>
      <a href="book.html">Reserve</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Reach</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="hero">
      <section class="hero-card">
        <h1>Investment tiers for focused aroma intensives</h1>
        <p class="lead">Choose a pathway designed to deepen your scent awareness and daily ritual. Safety-minded, evidence-informed approaches that may support emotional and sensory balance.</p>

        <div class="price-list" id="plans">
          <div class="plan">
            <div class="meta">
              <h3>Essence Dive — 90 minutes</h3>
              <p>One extended focused session with a tailored home-handout and a scent plan.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div style="text-align:right">$150</div>
              <button class="cta" onclick="location.href='book.html?plan=essence-dive'">Reserve this</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="plan">
            <div class="meta">
              <h3>Root & Rise — Two-session intensive</h3>
              <p>Two concentrated sessions spaced to refine your scent practice and coping tools.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div style="text-align:right">$270</div>
              <button class="cta" onclick="location.href='book.html?plan=root-rise'">Start the duo</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="plan">
            <div class="meta">
              <h3>Scent Steward — Monthly deep care</h3>
              <p>Four focused check-ins with evolving blends and at-home guidance.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div style="text-align:right">$480 / month</div>
              <button class="cta" onclick="location.href='book.html?plan=steward'">Enrol as steward</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="disclaimer">Sessions are intended to be supportive and non-medical. Please review safety notes in FAQ and let us know about pregnancy, pets, or chronic sensitivities before booking.</div>

      </section>

      <aside class="hero-card">
        <h3 style="margin-top:0">Why the tiers?</h3>
        <p class="lead">Each option scaffolds practice: single deep work, a paired refinement, or ongoing stewardship. You’ll receive dilution guidance, a patch-test routine, and scent storage notes.</p>

        <div class="proof" aria-live="polite">
          <div class="testimony" id="testimonial">
            <p class="quote">"A quiet, precise practice that made scent feel purposeful again."</p>
            <div class="who">— Mara, Portland</div>
          </div>

          <div class="badges" id="badges">
            <div class="badge">Certified Practitioner
              <div class="tooltip">Completed accredited aromatherapy training</div>
            </div>
            <div class="badge">Safety-first Protocols
              <div class="tooltip">Guidance on dilution, pregnancy, pets, and patch tests</div>
            </div>
            <div class="badge">Community Reviews
              <div class="tooltip">Hundreds of client reflections on care and craft</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </aside>
    </div>

    <section style="margin-top:26px;padding:20px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--glass-border)">
      <h3 style="margin:0 0 10px">Payment & scheduling</h3>
      <p class="lead">Payments can be made by card at booking. Sessions are scheduled by mutual availability; cancellations accepted with 48-hour notice for a refund. For questions: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}" style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none">{{EMAIL}}</a>.</p>
    </section>

    <footer>
      <div>
        <strong>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong>
        <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}" style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
      </div>
      <div><button onclick="location.href='book.html'" style="background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;color:#cdeee6">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button></div>
    </footer>

  </main>

  <svg class="pattern" viewBox="0 0 200 200" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden>
    <defs>
      <linearGradient id="g1" x1="0" x2="1">
        <stop offset="0" stop-color="#8FD3C7" stop-opacity="0.6"/>
        <stop offset="1" stop-color="#7AC1D8" stop-opacity="0.3"/>
      </linearGradient>
    </defs>
    <circle cx="40" cy="40" r="36" fill="url(#g1)"/>
    <circle cx="160" cy="160" r="28" fill="none" stroke="#6fbfb1" stroke-opacity="0.14"/>
    <g fill="#ffffff" opacity="0.02">
      <rect x="0" y="120" width="200" height="2"/>
      <rect x="0" y="90" width="200" height="2"/>
    </g>
  </svg>

  <script>
    // Rotating testimonial set
    (function(){
      const items = [
        {q: '"A quiet, precise practice that made scent feel purposeful again."', who: '— Mara, Portland'},
        {q: '"Clear guidance, gentle pace, and blends that suit my home life."', who: '— Jorge, Seattle'},
        {q: '"I appreciated the safety tips and the slow build of confidence."', who: '— Asha, Denver'},
        {q: '"Practical notes and a scent plan I actually use each morning."', who: '— L., Minneapolis'}
      ];
      let i=0;
      const quoteEl=document.getElementById('testimonial');
      function show(){
        quoteEl.querySelector('.quote').textContent = items[i].q;
        quoteEl.querySelector('.who').textContent = items[i].who;
        i = (i+1)%items.length;
      }
      show();
      setInterval(show,4200);
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"about.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Story — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#07121a;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);--accent:#B2E6D9;--muted:#9bb0b0;font-family:"Segoe UI",Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif}
    body{margin:0;min-height:100vh;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#061014 0%,#07121a 100%);color:#e8fbf3}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:18px 26px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}
    .logo{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .logo-box{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#9bded0,#7fb7d8);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;color:#022429}
    nav a{color:#cfeee1;margin-left:10px;text-decoration:none}
    main{max-width:980px;margin:30px auto;padding:20px}
    .intro{display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:flex-start}
    .glass{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.03),transparent);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);padding:18px;border-radius:12px}
    h1{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:26px}
    p.lead{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 340px;gap:18px;margin-top:16px}
    .timeline{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0}
    .timeline li{padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}
    .cred{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:12px}
    .cred .item{padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}

    /* Proof gallery */
    .proof-wrap{margin-top:16px}
    .proof-display{padding:14px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}
    .quote{font-size:15px;margin:0}
    .who{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-top:8px}
    .cred-badges{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px}
    .cred-badges .badge{position:relative;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}
    .cred-badges .badge .tip{display:none;position:absolute;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);top:-36px;background:#012126;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px}
    .cred-badges .badge:hover .tip{display:block}

    footer{margin-top:26px;padding:18px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03);display:flex;justify-content:space-between}

    @media(max-width:880px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="logo"><div class="logo-box">A</div><div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div></div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Sanctum</a>
      <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
      <a href="blends.html">Formulas</a>
      <a href="shop.html">Apothecary</a>
      <a href="pricing.html">Investment</a>
      <a href="about.html" style="font-weight:600;color:#fff">Story</a>
      <a href="book.html">Reserve</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Reach</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="intro">
      <div class="glass" style="flex:1">
        <h1>Our approach — craft, care, and clarity</h1>
        <p class="lead">We use botanical aromatics as a supportive craft—designing scent experiences that may support moments of calm, focus, or ritual. Every plan begins with safety screening and a practical at-home guide.</p>

        <div style="margin-top:12px">
          <strong>Core values</strong>
          <div class="cred" aria-hidden>
            <div class="item">Safety-first instruction</div>
            <div class="item">Evidence-informed sourcing</div>
            <div class="item">Small, repeatable practices</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside style="width:340px">
        <div class="glass">
          <strong>Quick facts</strong>
          <ul style="padding-left:18px;margin:8px 0;color:var(--muted)">
            <li>In-person and remote sessions</li>
            <li>All blends include dilution guidelines</li>
            <li>Patch-test procedures provided</li>
          </ul>
          <div style="margin-top:8px"><button onclick="location.href='book.html'" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#76c9d9);border:none;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;color:#012222;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer">Begin a session</button></div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <div class="grid">
      <div class="glass">
        <h3 style="margin-top:0">Journey & qualifications</h3>
        <ul class="timeline">
          <li><strong>2015</strong> — Trained in clinical aromatics and botanical safety protocols.</li>
          <li><strong>2018</strong> — Launched small-group scent workshops for community care.</li>
          <li><strong>2021</strong> — Developed guided at-home scent practices and materials.</li>
        </ul>

        <div style="margin-top:12px">
          <h4 style="margin:0">Testimonials</h4>
          <div class="proof-wrap">
            <div class="proof-display" id="proof">
              <p class="quote">"Professional, practical, and somehow gentle in approach."</p>
              <div class="who">— K., Oakland</div>
            </div>

            <div class="cred-badges" id="credBadges">
              <div class="badge">Accredited Training<div class="tip">Verified aromatherapy certification</div></div>
              <div class="badge">Ethical Sourcing<div class="tip">Plant-forward sourcing policies</div></div>
              <div class="badge">Client-reviewed<div class="tip">Ratings from independent clients</div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="glass">
        <h3 style="margin-top:0">How we measure care</h3>
        <p style="color:var(--muted)">Consultation includes a safety checklist, allergy and pregnancy screening, guidance for households with pets, and a patch-test routine before any concentrated blend is recommended.</p>

        <h4 style="margin-top:10px">Safety notes</h4>
        <ul style="color:var(--muted);padding-left:18px">
          <li>All blends include dilution percentages and storage notes.</li>
          <li>Patch testing is recommended at least 24–48 hours prior to concentrated use.</li>
          <li>We provide pet-safety guidance; please disclose all animals during booking.</li>
          <li>If pregnant or nursing, discuss with your care provider; we avoidRecommend concentrated use without oversight.</li>
        </ul>

        <div style="margin-top:12px"><button onclick="location.href='contact.html'" style="background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);padding:10px;border-radius:10px;color:#cdeee6">Ask about safety</button></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <footer>
      <div>
        <strong>Ready to explore?</strong>
        <div style="color:var(--muted)">Book an exploratory session or ask a question: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}" style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
      </div>
      <div><button onclick="location.href='book.html'" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,#9bded0,#7fb7d8);color:#012426;border:none;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px">Reserve time</button></div>
    </footer>
  </main>

  <script>
    // Rotate proof snippets and cycle badges tooltips
    (function(){
      const snippets = [
        {q:'"Professional, practical, and somehow gentle in approach."', who:'— K., Oakland'},
        {q:'"Clear instructions, nourishing blends, and thoughtful follow-up."', who:'— S., Boston'},
        {q:'"The at-home notes made all the difference — easy to use."', who:'— T., Austin'}
      ];
      let idx=0;
      const display=document.getElementById('proof');
      function rotate(){
        display.querySelector('.quote').textContent = snippets[idx].q;
        display.querySelector('.who').textContent = snippets[idx].who;
        idx=(idx+1)%snippets.length;
      }
      rotate();setInterval(rotate,4800);

      // subtle badge animation
      const badges=document.querySelectorAll('#credBadges .badge');
      badges.forEach((b,i)=>{b.addEventListener('mouseenter',()=>{b.style.transform='translateY(-6px)';});b.addEventListener('mouseleave',()=>{b.style.transform='translateY(0)';});});
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"book.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Reserve — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#07121a;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);--accent:#9FE0D1;--muted:#9fbab5}
    body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,"Helvetica Neue",Arial;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#041216 0%,#07121a 100%);color:#e9fbf5}
    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:16px 22px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}
    nav a{color:#cfeee1;margin-left:12px;text-decoration:none}
    main{max-width:1000px;margin:28px auto;padding:20px}
    .wrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:20px}
    .card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);padding:18px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}
    h1{margin:0 0 8px}
    p.lead{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}
    form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-top:12px}
    input,select,textarea{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);color:#eafff7;padding:10px;border-radius:10px}
    button.submit{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#7ac1d8);border:none;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;color:#012425;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}

    /* Aroma wheel */
    .wheel-wrap{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center}
    .wheel{width:320px;height:320px;border-radius:50%;position:relative;background:conic-gradient(#f7fffb 0 120deg,#e6fff9 120deg 240deg,#d9fff5 240deg 360deg);box-shadow:inset 0 -20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
    .wheel .center{width:120px;height:120px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(0,0,0,0.28);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#dff7f2}
    .note-legend{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;margin-top:12px}
    .note{padding:8px 10px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);font-size:13px;cursor:default}

    .description{margin-top:12px;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);min-height:64px;color:var(--muted)}

    @media(max-width:980px){.wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center"><div style="width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#9fe0d1,#7fb7d8);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;color:#032425">A</div><strong>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong></div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Sanctum</a>
      <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
      <a href="blends.html">Formulas</a>
      <a href="shop.html">Apothecary</a>
      <a href="pricing.html">Investment</a>
      <a href="about.html">Story</a>
      <a href="book.html" style="font-weight:600;color:#fff">Reserve</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Reach</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="card">
        <h1>Reserve your focused scent session</h1>
        <p class="lead">Select a time, share any sensitivities, and explore the aroma wheel to preview top, middle, and base notes. All sessions include dilution and patch-test guidance.</p>

        <form id="booking">
          <label>Full name<input type="text" name="name" required placeholder="Your name"></label>
          <label>Email<input type="email" name="email" required placeholder="you@domain.com"></label>
          <label>Phone<input type="tel" name="phone" placeholder="{{PHONE}}"></label>
          <label>Select plan
            <select name="plan">
              <option value="essence-dive">Essence Dive — 90m</option>
              <option value="root-rise">Root & Rise — 2 sessions</option>
              <option value="steward">Scent Steward — monthly</option>
            </select>
          </label>
          <label>Known allergies, pregnancy, or pets<textarea name="notes" rows="3" placeholder="Please list anything we should know"></textarea></label>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center"><button class="submit" type="submit">Secure a spot</button><div style="color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">You will receive a confirmation email with next steps.</div></div>
        </form>

      </div>

      <aside class="card">
        <h3 style="margin-top:0">Aroma wheel — hover a band</h3>
        <div class="wheel-wrap">
          <div class="wheel" id="wheel" role="img" aria-label="Aroma wheel">
            <div class="center" id="centerLabel">Notes</div>
          </div>

          <div class="note-legend">
            <div class="note" data-type="top">Top: Citrus, Green</div>
            <div class="note" data-type="middle">Middle: Floral, Herbal</div>
            <div class="note" data-type="base">Base: Woody, Resinous</div>
          </div>

          <div class="description" id="noteDesc">Hover over a legend label or touch a wheel segment to see more about that family.</div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:12px">
          <strong>Quick prep</strong>
          <p style="color:var(--muted);margin:8px 0">We recommend a patch test 24–48 hours prior to using concentrated blends. For pets and pregnancy, discuss options before arrival; we will suggest gentle alternatives.</p>
        </div>
      </aside>
